    "4"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "\\(|x + 3| = 7\\) means \\(x + 3 = 7\\) or \\(x + 3 = -7\\).",
    "So \\(x = 4\\) or \\(x = -10\\). The positive solution is \\(4\\)."
  ],
  "explanation": null,
  "traps": null,
